blish that the referent is the RIGHT one, so a confidently wrong path would still score CLEAN; the instrument invokes the CLI twice per probe (once for output, once for status), which is safe only because every current probe refuses before mutating anything and would need revisiting for a stateful probe; the exit code for a previously-uncaught throw changes from 1 to 70, which nothing in the suite asserted before this change; the published-6.0.0 baseline could not be reproduced by the reviewer, who had no network; and measurements remain point-in-time, with trend sink and delta reporting deferred to #1258 deliberately without a count ratchet. Scoped to this author and branch only.",
